adc8ee52cd58982f9a340b48b41602/ss_6016d0d078adc8ee52cd58982f9a340b48b41602.600x338.jpg?t=1746657823"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341800/ss_46100714dad26845ad543b534d88d0ec5771eac4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746657823","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341800/ss_46100714dad26845ad543b534d88d0ec5771eac4.600x338.jpg?t=1746657823"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341800/9544ccb567f3b20ab579ba063e6917c0ee8a9d55/ss_9544ccb567f3b20ab579ba063e6917c0ee8a9d55.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746657823","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341800/9544ccb567f3b20ab579ba063e6917c0ee8a9d55/ss_9544ccb567f3b20ab579ba063e6917c0ee8a9d55.600x338.jpg?t=1746657823"}],"short_description":"Learn about the mysterious goings on at Phantom Trails National Park as the newest Deputy Ranger. Explore at your own pace and collect debris left behind by the storm, getting by with your compass, map and flashlight. Use trail markers and your own memory to find your way through the damaged park.","steam_appid":3341800,"support_info":{"email":"deadbugtalks@gmail.com","url":"www.deadbugtalks.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://deadbugtalks.com/games/"}